${completedCount} completed job${completedCount === 1 ? "" : "s"} recovered from the transcripts (main + every subagent); full list in \`jobs.json\`.${jobs?.live ? " A live snapshot of running/recent jobs is also included." : ""} Per-job output lives in the owning transcript and in \`artifacts/*.log\`.

## Subagents (${manifest.subagents.length})

${subagentLines}

## Totals

${manifest.totals.files} files, ${manifest.totals.bytes} bytes.
${manifest.omitted.length > 0 ? `\nOmitted:\n${manifest.omitted.map(o => `- ${o}`).join("\n")}\n` : ""}`;
